url: https://reblocke.github.io/U-of-U-IM-Codes-and-Rapid-Responses/
abstract: >-
  Learner-facing course website and materials for the University of Utah Internal
  Medicine residency seminar on leading Code Blue and Rapid Response teams. The
  2026 interdisciplinary update organizes the site as a guided learner hub with
  micro-skill modules, scenarios, resources, facilitator notes, and a module on
  productive collaboration with bedside nurses, nurse-led response teams, and
  critical care outreach nurses. The 2025 class version is archived at GitHub
  release v2025.06.
